{"availability":"available","full":"JustaLab-co/x402-near-intents-demo","name":"x402-near-intents-demo","description":"Pay for a cross-chain swap quote over x402 and settle it through NEAR Intents, from a web app or an AI agent with a spending cap","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T02:57:34Z","updated":"2026-10-08T03:10:19Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://x402-near-intents-demo.vercel.app","topics":["account-abstraction","ai-agents","arbitrum","base","cross-chain","jaw-id","mcp","near","near-intents","nextjs","passkeys","swap","usdc","x402"],"demo":"https://x402-near-intents-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:05.106Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:05.106Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:49:05.106Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:48.618Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:49:05.106Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A web app that pays for a cross-chain swap quote over x402 and settles the swap through NEAR Intents. The wallet is a JAW.id smart account that signs with a passkey."],"features":["The app asks the JAW.id API for a swap quote (GET /proxy/v2/swap/quote).","The API answers 402 Payment Required and asks for 0.005 USDC on Base.","The passkey signs an EIP-3009 transferWithAuthorization, and the app repeats the same request with the PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header. The facilitator settles the payment and the API returns the quote.","The app sends USDC to the one-time NEAR Intents deposit address from the quote.","A NEAR Intents solver delivers USDC to the same address on the destination chain, while the app polls the deposit status."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/JustaLab-co/x402-near-intents-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1c2a6690e797ea951790131b3c73d535fd73f5f081c1cca8a096f8c712b73ed1","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:01:48.725Z"},"overviewCheckedAt